    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you know? The 12 Chinese Zodiacs have Yin-Yang attributes, divided into six Yin and six Yang \u2014 this is <u>the meaning of &quot;Six-Six&quot;</u>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/7923d2b9c3f089804238584c30bc427b.avif?t=1755303835\" width=600 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In CZ Wars, the 12 Zodiacs are personified as 12 unique Zodiac Maidens with distinct personalities and skills. When ancient primordial beasts suddenly invade, you must lead them to fight back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/7a70be9de65cf9f3061005aea67c72a5.avif?t=1755303835\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Build a Synergized Team\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/50ff13a27bd5e732e2fc7343e062cfbf.avif?t=1755303835\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/956fab866c7a2609bdbcffdf0a445d96.poster.avif?t=1755303835\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/956fab866c7a2609bdbcffdf0a445d96.webm?t=1755303835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/956fab866c7a2609bdbcffdf0a445d96.mp4?t=1755303835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each run, choose 3 Zodiac Maidens. Pay attention to their Yin-Yang attributes \u2014 different combinations unlock unique magic artifacts. The right artifacts will double your efficiency!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Choose Your Path Wisely\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/c148bc237094189440bb7079131a10b6.poster.avif?t=1755303835\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/c148bc237094189440bb7079131a10b6.webm?t=1755303835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/c148bc237094189440bb7079131a10b6.mp4?t=1755303835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During each floor\u2019s battle, selecting an event card will alert the floor\u2019s boss. Plan your route carefully: prepare before the boss fully notices you, or challenge it early for greater rewards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Manage Resources Strategically\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/7870e4dd4311e17e79271904808944d4.poster.avif?t=1755303835\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/7870e4dd4311e17e79271904808944d4.webm?t=1755303835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/7870e4dd4311e17e79271904808944d4.mp4?t=1755303835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn coins and insights through battles and random events to upgrade your Maidens, unlock passive skills, and forge countless paths to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Diverse Combat Mechanics\u3011</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/705ca8545dd5b4c410bd883f5b3d2112.poster.avif?t=1755303835\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/705ca8545dd5b4c410bd883f5b3d2112.webm?t=1755303835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/705ca8545dd5b4c410bd883f5b3d2112.mp4?t=1755303835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consider positioning, Five Elements cycle (mutual promotion and restraint), attack/defense attributes, and passive counters. Move tiles to trigger match-3 combos, command Maidens, and crush foes with high-damage chains!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Humorous &amp; Referential Story\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover main quests, side stories, anecdotes, and Zodiac archives \u2014 tens of thousands of words filled with lore, easter eggs, and tributes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Epic Crossovers\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CZ Wars will collaborate with other indie games. Will you meet beloved characters or even indie developers in the Maidens\u2019 world? Explore to find out!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you know? The 12 Chinese Zodiacs have Yin-Yang attributes, divided into six Yin and six Yang \u2014 this is <u>the meaning of &quot;Six-Six&quot;</u>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/7923d2b9c3f089804238584c30bc427b.avif?t=1755303835\" width=600 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In CZ Wars, the 12 Zodiacs are personified as 12 unique Zodiac Maidens with distinct personalities and skills. When ancient primordial beasts suddenly invade, you must lead them to fight back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/7a70be9de65cf9f3061005aea67c72a5.avif?t=1755303835\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Build a Synergized Team\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/50ff13a27bd5e732e2fc7343e062cfbf.avif?t=1755303835\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/956fab866c7a2609bdbcffdf0a445d96.poster.avif?t=1755303835\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/956fab866c7a2609bdbcffdf0a445d96.webm?t=1755303835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/956fab866c7a2609bdbcffdf0a445d96.mp4?t=1755303835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each run, choose 3 Zodiac Maidens. Pay attention to their Yin-Yang attributes \u2014 different combinations unlock unique magic artifacts. The right artifacts will double your efficiency!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Choose Your Path Wisely\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/c148bc237094189440bb7079131a10b6.poster.avif?t=1755303835\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/c148bc237094189440bb7079131a10b6.webm?t=1755303835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/c148bc237094189440bb7079131a10b6.mp4?t=1755303835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During each floor\u2019s battle, selecting an event card will alert the floor\u2019s boss. Plan your route carefully: prepare before the boss fully notices you, or challenge it early for greater rewards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Manage Resources Strategically\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/7870e4dd4311e17e79271904808944d4.poster.avif?t=1755303835\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/7870e4dd4311e17e79271904808944d4.webm?t=1755303835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/7870e4dd4311e17e79271904808944d4.mp4?t=1755303835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn coins and insights through battles and random events to upgrade your Maidens, unlock passive skills, and forge countless paths to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Diverse Combat Mechanics\u3011</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/705ca8545dd5b4c410bd883f5b3d2112.poster.avif?t=1755303835\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/705ca8545dd5b4c410bd883f5b3d2112.webm?t=1755303835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400030/extras/705ca8545dd5b4c410bd883f5b3d2112.mp4?t=1755303835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consider positioning, Five Elements cycle (mutual promotion and restraint), attack/defense attributes, and passive counters. Move tiles to trigger match-3 combos, command Maidens, and crush foes with high-damage chains!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Humorous &amp; Referential Story\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover main quests, side stories, anecdotes, and Zodiac archives \u2014 tens of thousands of words filled with lore, easter eggs, and tributes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Epic Crossovers\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CZ Wars will collaborate with other indie games. Will you meet beloved characters or even indie developers in the Maidens\u2019 world? Explore to find out!</p>",
    "short_description": "CZ Wars is a roguelike strategy game blending match-3 and buff-building. Partner with 12 Zodiac Maidens to repel ancient primordial beasts. Navigate random events, battles, and upgrades. Carefully choose paths, manage resources, and empower your Maidens to secure victory.",
